<title>NETHERLANDS: HOEK LOOS ISSUE PRICED AT DFL 169.00/SHARE.</title>
<headline>HOEK LOOS ISSUE PRICED AT DFL 169.00/SHARE.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The issue of 600,591 shares by chemicals firm Hoek Loos has been priced at 169.00 guilders per share, issue manager ABN AMRO Rothschild said on Thursday.  </p>
<p>&quot;Around 75 percent of the (600,591) shares have been placed with existing major shareholders,&quot; ABN AMRO said.</p>
<p>The remainder has been especially allocated to Dutch retail investors and Dutch institutional investors.</p>
<p>Payment for the allocated shares has to be made at the office of subscription on Tuesday, November 26.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +020 - 504 5000</p>
